0 FILE 1621 - Lunar MPV Vehicle.ldr
0 Complete Futuron-era lunar MPV vehicle composed of a front cockpit section, articulated wheeled chassis, rear cargo bed with container, a minifig astronaut with airtanks and blue helmet, and a small droid companion.
0 Name: 1621 - Lunar MPV Vehicle.ldr
0 Author: Damien Roux [Darats]
